<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Dark and cheerless is the morn</l><l>Unaccompanied by Thee;</l><l>Joyless is the day’s return,</l><l>Till Thy mercy’s beams I see,</l><l>Till Thou inward light impart,</l><l>Glad my eyes, and warm my heart.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Visit then this soul of mine,</l><l>Pierce the gloom of sin and grief;</l><l>Fill me, Radiancy divine,</l><l>Scatter all my unbelief;</l><l>More and more Thyself display,</l><l>Shining to the perfect day.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
